== (A) numeral instances of three universal axioms, each instance treated as a separate ground target ==
  cluster ['Q3s'] size 4 -> ['(t0+0)=t0']
  cluster ['Q5s'] size 4 -> ['(t0*0)=0']
  cluster ['Q4s'] size 4 -> ['(t0+St1)=S((t0+t1))']
  accepts (a1+0)=a1                    True
  accepts (a1*0)=0                     True
  accepts (SSSSSSS0+0)=SSSSSSS0        True
  accepts (a1+Sa2)=S((a1+a2))          True
  (a1 is a parameter: closure-normal form, so a1+0=a1 is the universal axiom forall x (x+0=x))

== (B) instances of a false universal: 0*0=0, S0*S0=S0 (n*n=n holds for n=0,1) ==
  minimal template (t0*t0)=t0  refutation: (('=', ('*', ('p', 'q1'), ('p', 'q1')), ('p', 'q1')), "D0+forallE {'q1': 2}")
  DTRC clusters: [1, 1]   accepts 2*2=2? False
== (B2) instances of a true universal: 0*0=0*0... e.g. not(n*n = 2): ==
  minimal template ¬(t0*t0)=SS0  refutation: None
  DTRC clusters: [3]   accepts the universal not(a1*a1=2)? True

== (C) non-transitivity: a = 0+0=0, b = S0+0=S0, c = 0+S0=S0 ==
  ab  coherent: True   minimal templates: ['(t0+0)=t0 [unrefuted]']
  ac  coherent: True   minimal templates: ['(0+t0)=t0 [unrefuted]']
  bc  coherent: False  minimal templates: ['(t0+t1)=S0 [refuted: (0+0)=S0]']
  abc coherent: False  minimal templates: ['(t0+t1)=t2 [refuted: (0+0)=S0]']
  DTRC order ['(0+0)=0', '(S0+0)=S0', '(0+S0)=S0'] -> [['(0+0)=0', '(S0+0)=S0'], ['(0+S0)=S0']]
  DTRC order ['(0+0)=0', '(0+S0)=S0', '(S0+0)=S0'] -> [['(0+0)=0', '(0+S0)=S0'], ['(S0+0)=S0']]
  DTRC order ['(S0+0)=S0', '(0+S0)=S0', '(0+0)=0'] -> [['(0+0)=0', '(S0+0)=S0'], ['(0+S0)=S0']]
  DTRC order ['(0+S0)=S0', '(S0+0)=S0', '(0+0)=0'] -> [['(0+0)=0', '(0+S0)=S0'], ['(S0+0)=S0']]
  single linkage on the pairwise graph merges {a,b,c} into one cluster, whose minimal templates are all refuted.
